# Research
tc.research_category.THAUMIC_TINKERER=Thaumic Tinkering
thaumictinkerer.research.thaumic_tinkerer_base.title=Thaumic Tinkering
thaumictinkerer.research.thaumic_tinkerer_base.title.subtitle=Excluding the word 'Construct'
thaumictinkerer.research.thaumic_tinkerer_base.stage.1=The universe is a grand clockwork machine, or so the scholars say...<BR>There are several bits of research that I've tinkered with that are too small or too specific to fit anywhere, that's what this collection of bits and bobs is for.<PAGE>Arcane Quartz<DIV>A uniquely interesting material, arcane quartz is not particularly useful on it's own but it does integrate cleanly with arcane mechanisms.<BR>These properties will be useful for any future devices I might conceive.<PAGE>Thaumium Plated Stone<DIV>When cobblestone just isn't enough, why not add some thaumium plating?<BR>This results in a significantly more resistant material that is relatively cheap to manufacture.

