thaumictinkerer.research.ender_mirror.title.subtitle=A 'pocket' to the fourth dimension
thaumictinkerer.research.ender_mirror.stage.1=If a magical hand mirror can grant me access to linked mirrors across dimensions, how much harder would it be to create something that access my personal ender chest inventory?
thaumictinkerer.research.ender_mirror.stage.2=I have successfully managed to modify a magical hand mirror that will allow me to access my ender chest inventory from anywhere.

