# -- EQUIPMENT: Feline Charm
thaumictinkerer.research.feline_charm.title=Feline Charm
thaumictinkerer.research.feline_charm.title.subtitle=Like black cats on a bad day
thaumictinkerer.research.feline_charm.stage.1=Creepers are a constant frustration. Not only do they blend into the environment, they also have a nasty penchant to hide behind walls and sneak up behind me.<BR>Perhaps I can create a tool that that can somehow neutralize these creatures.
thaumictinkerer.research.feline_charm.stage.2=I have devised an amulet that muddles the perception of nearby creepers.<BR>While it cannot fully nutralize creeper detonations, while equipped, the feline amulet instils fear into nearby creepers, causing them to flee as though they were in the presence of a cat.<BR>So long as I do not perform hostile actions against the creatures, the amulet shouild grant me relative safety from their suicidal attacks.

# -- EQUIPMENT: Ignium Striker
thaumictinkerer.research.ignium_striker.title=Ignium Striker
thaumictinkerer.research.ignium_striker.title.subtitle=Who needs a flint when you have the elements?
thaumictinkerer.research.ignium_striker.stage.1=I was struck with strange realization. Despite how far I have come, I am still relying on a rudimentary flint and steel to light fires.<BR>Since thaumaturgy has yielded solutions for every other mild inconvenience, why not apply it to this?
thaumictinkerer.research.ignium_striker.stage.2=I have created designs for a vis powered striker. Not only is this tool virtually indestructible, the reliance on vis rather than physical durability means the device is easily replenished through normal vis recharging.

# -- EQUIPMENT: Infusion Enchantment: Educational
thaumictinkerer.research.educational_infusion.title=Infusion Enchantment: Educational
thaumictinkerer.research.educational_infusion.title.subtitle=You will LEARN!
thaumictinkerer.research.educational_infusion.stage.1=[WIP]
thaumictinkerer.research.educational_infusion.stage.2=[WIP]

